}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Unread Count
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/notifications/unread-count`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mendapatkan jumlah notifikasi belum dibaca",
    "data": {
      "count": 5
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
